        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    autonumber\n    actor Parent as Parent (User)\n    participant Frontend as Frontend (App/Web)\n    participant Google as Google Identity / OAuth 2.0\n    participant Backend as Backend API (FastAPI)\n    participant DB as Database (PostgreSQL)\n\n    Parent-&gt;&gt;Frontend: Click \&quot;Log in with Google\&quot;\n    Frontend-&gt;&gt;Google: Launch Google Sign-In popup\n    Google--&gt;&gt;Frontend: Return Google ID Token\n    \n    Frontend-&gt;&gt;Backend: POST /api/auth/google/login (id_token)\n    \n    Backend-&gt;&gt;Google: Verify ID Token signature &amp; validity\n    Google--&gt;&gt;Backend: Token payload (email, google_sub)\n    \n    Backend-&gt;&gt;DB: Query parent by google_id OR email\n    \n    alt Account exists (Registered user)\n        DB--&gt;&gt;Backend: Return parent record\n        Backend-&gt;&gt;Backend: Generate App JWT tokens\n        Backend--&gt;&gt;Frontend: 200 OK (JWT Access Token + Parent Info)\n        Frontend--&gt;&gt;Parent: Redirect to Parent Dashboard\n        \n    else Account not found (Unregistered user)\n        DB--&gt;&gt;Backend: No record found\n        Backend--&gt;&gt;Frontend: 404 Not Found / 401 Unauthorized (\&quot;No account found with this Google email\&quot;)\n        Frontend--&gt;&gt;Parent: Show error: \&quot;Account not registered. Please sign up first.\&quot; (Show Sign-Up button)\n    end\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null,&#xa;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;12&quot;&#xa;}" id="kETcdjN6PrORxJ3qfmwF-1">
